    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University held a ceremony on July 11, 2021, to name a laboratory at the Centre for Regenerative Medicine and Stem Cell Research (CRM) after the late Dr Parveen Kanji, a passionate and dedicated medical professional in the field of obstetrics and gynecology.",
